{"repositoryId":1120360369,"availability":"available","full":"bearing-research/strata","name":"strata","description":"Strata is a notebook your coding agent can drive, and everything it computes stays.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":5,"forks":1,"created":"2025-12-21T03:30:09Z","updated":"2026-10-15T06:59:12Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://bearing-research.github.io/strata/","topics":["agent-tools","content-addressed","lineage","notebook","orchestration","provenance","tui","vue"],"demo":"https://bearing-research.github.io/strata/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T11:21:08.504Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T11:21:08.504Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T11:21:08.504Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T11:21:08.504Z","stars":5,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Vue","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Strata is a notebook your coding agent can drive, and everything it computes stays.","Coding agents explore by writing throwaway scripts: python -c, files in /tmp, invisible and gone by the next session. Point one at Strata and the work lands in a notebook instead. Every result is cached by what produced it, every cell records who wrote it, and the whole thing is open in your browser while the agent works. Come back tomorrow and it is all still there, already computed.","That holds because of what a cell is. Each one is keyed by its source, its inputs and its environment, so the expensive step an agent ran ten turns ago is a cache hit now, and the same inputs give the same result a year later on another machine. Change one cell and only the cells below it run again. Nothing is recomputed to prove a point."],"features":["a scratchpad that lasts: a Claude Code plugin points an agent at a cached notebook cell instead of a /tmp script, so the snippet it ran ten turns ago is still there","any MCP client: a warm notebook session is exposed at /mcp, and you can watch the agent work in the browser or the terminal while it does","built to be scripted: strata inspects, runs and authors a notebook with JSON output and stable exit codes, offline or against a live session","one command to start: strata agent ./nb stands up the server, the session, the config and the viewer together","you can tell who did what: every cell records whether a person or an agent wrote it"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bearing-research/strata/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"87b26ed9d8cef946a3927e3542fce2fb01f5c93a59092b94651e41e1a9a0d016","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T11:21:08.604Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T11:21:08.604Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Strata is a notebook your coding agent can drive, and everything it computes stays.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bearing-research/strata/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"a figure gets a URL: publish an artifact and anyone with the link sees the plot, the code, and the environment of every step behind it, with no account and no install","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bearing-research/strata/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"87b26ed9d8cef946a3927e3542fce2fb01f5c93a59092b94651e41e1a9a0d016","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bearing-research/strata/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T11:21:08.605Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T06:59:12Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/bearing-research/strata/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T11:21:08.607Z","hash":"87b26ed9d8cef946a3927e3542fce2fb01f5c93a59092b94651e41e1a9a0d016","originalBytes":24027,"storedBytes":24027,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["cell","notebook","strata","run","cells","install","one","agent","every","python","what","server","worker","artifact","runs","data","own","inputs","only","strata-notebook","tool","cache","cached","code","live","mcp","mode","model","name","over","result","same","dag",